ance/2026/04/12/G43DQNDBGE2DQYRVGNTDSZBVMQ/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The balloon effect of the regulation of household loans by the five major banks... Inbang's loan balance increased by 550 billion won in the first quarter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/stock-finance/2026/04/12/G43DQNDBGE2DQYRVGNTDSZBVMQ/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;5대銀 가계대출 규제 풍선효과…인뱅 1분기 대출잔액 5500억원 늘어&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MY4DAZLBMQZDQM3GHAYDKNRUME.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/04/12/GA3DGOJUGJSWMYRWMI2TAOJUGY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Industry Minister Kim Jung-kwan: "It is likely to pass April ~ May without releasing government oil reserves"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/04/12/GA3DGOJUGJSWMYRWMI2TAOJUGY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;김정관 산업부 장관 “정부 비축유 방출 없이 4~5월 넘길 듯”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/RC7VNEGOWBPMLAGQQDCWRS6FLM.JPG" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/money/2026/04/12/IZYLPHQDURBZHCFCSXNKGZFSJQ/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Bank of Korea: "The semiconductor boom will continue at least until the first half of next year"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/money/2026/04/12/IZYLPHQDURBZHCFCSXNKGZFSJQ/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;한국은행 “반도체 호황 적어도 내년 상반기까지 지속”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GI3WMMJTMZTDINLFHFSTKMBZMM.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/real_estate/2026/04/12/GY2TCYRTGQZDAZLBG42WGOBYMU/" style